---
import StaticPageLayout from '../layouts/StaticPageLayout.astro';
---
<StaticPageLayout
  title="Email List Privacy"
  description="How RecursiveProphet.com collects, uses, and protects email-list subscription information."
  eyebrow="Last updated: July 28, 2026"
>
  <p>
    This notice covers the Recursive Prophet email list operated by
    <strong>TKTK-legal-operator</strong> through RecursiveProphet.com.
  </p>

  <section>
    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <p>When you subscribe, we collect:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>The email address you provide</li>
      <li>The date and time you submit the form</li>
      <li>The date and time you confirm the subscription</li>
      <li>The IP address used to confirm the subscription</li>
      <li>The website and mailing list associated with the subscription</li>
      <li>The version of the consent language shown when you subscribed</li>
      <li>Your subscription and unsubscribe status</li>
    </ul>
    <p>We do not store the IP address from the initial form submission in your subscriber record.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>How we use the information</h2>
    <p>
      We use this information to confirm your subscription, deliver Chapter 1 and The First File,
      send occasional emails from Chris Everson about Recursive Prophet, prevent fraudulent
      subscriptions, and maintain evidence of your subscription choices.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Who processes it</h2>
    <p>
      The subscription is transmitted through a server-side relay operated for
      RecursiveProphet.com and stored and processed using MailerLite. MailerLite provides
      mailing-list and email-delivery services and processes subscriber information on our behalf.
      MailerLite may use its contracted subprocessors to provide and secure those services.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>No sale or audience sharing</h2>
    <p>
      We do not sell, rent, or trade subscriber information. Recursive Prophet subscribers are not
      added to the Shaggy Palms mailing list or combined with another marketing audience.
    </p>
    <p>
      Information is disclosed only to service providers needed to operate, deliver, and secure the
      Recursive Prophet email list, or when disclosure is required by law.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Retention</h2>
    <p>We keep subscription information while you remain subscribed.</p>
    <p>
      If you unsubscribe, marketing emails stop and your address is moved out of the active mailing
      list. We may retain a limited suppression and consent record only as long as reasonably
      necessary to honor your unsubscribe request, prevent accidental resubscription, and document
      compliance.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Unsubscribing and deletion</h2>
    <p>Every marketing email includes an unsubscribe link. You may unsubscribe at any time.</p>
    <p>
      You may contact <strong>TKTK-privacy-email</strong> to request access to, correction of, or
      deletion of your subscriber information. When deletion is appropriate, we will permanently
      remove the subscriber record using MailerLite’s deletion process, subject to any information
      that must temporarily remain in protected backups or be retained by law. MailerLite states
      that its “Forget” process completely deletes subscriber information within 30 days.
    </p>
    <p>Questions about this notice may be sent to <strong>TKTK-privacy-email</strong>.</p>
  </section>

  <div class="static-actions">
    <a class="static-action" href="/">Return home</a>
  </div>
</StaticPageLayout>
